---
import AppLayout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="Case Study: Engineering & Metal Unit, Tamil Nadu | 1.5MW Wind | OnLoop Energy" description="Case Study: 1.5MW Wind Power system for a heavy engineering metal processing unit in Tamil Nadu, India. ₹51L monthly bill offset by 55% with ~₹28.0L/month savings and ~3.8 years payback.">
<div>

  {/* Hero Section */}
  <section class="hero hero--short">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__content">
        <div class="hero__badge" style="margin-top: var(--space-12);">
          <span class="hero__badge-dot"></span>
          Case Study Detail
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero__title">
          Engineering & Metal Unit, Tamil Nadu<br />
          <span class="hero__title-highlight">1.5MW Pure Wind Turbine System</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__subtitle">Tamil Nadu, India • Heavy Engineering & Metal Fabrication</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Quick Key Numbers Bar */}
  <div style="background: var(--color-bg-secondary); border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding: var(--space-6) 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-4" style="text-align: center; gap: var(--space-4);">
        <div>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">System Capacity</span>
          <strong style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">1.5MW Wind</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Monthly Bill Offset</span>
          <strong style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-primary);">55% Offset</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Monthly Savings</span>
          <strong style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #10b981;">~₹28.0 Lakhs / mo</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Payback Period</span>
          <strong style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">~3.8 Years</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Main Case Study Content */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in" style="padding: var(--space-12) 0;">
    <div class="container container--narrow">

      {/* Facility Overview */}
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10);">
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xl); color: var(--color-text-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Facility Overview</h2>
        <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-base); color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;">
          Located in Tamil Nadu, India, this heavy engineering plant manufactures precision metal castings and automotive structural components. Operating heavy induction furnaces, CNC machining centers, and stamping presses, the plant recorded a monthly grid electricity bill of <strong>₹51 Lakhs</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* The Challenge */}
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10); background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-8); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); color: var(--color-text-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">The Challenge</h2>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8;">
          <li><strong>Heavy Induction Furnace Loads:</strong> High inductive load surges created severe peak demand surcharges during shift changes.</li>
          <li><strong>Grid Power Quality Harmonics:</strong> Voltage sags on the utility grid tripped CNC machining centers, damaging precision tooling.</li>
          <li><strong>High Base Operating Costs:</strong> Utility power tariffs represented a significant portion of component unit manufacturing cost.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* The Solution */}
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10); background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-8); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); color: var(--color-text-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">The Solution</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
          OnLoop Energy deployed a <strong>1.5MW Captive Wind Turbine System</strong> equipped with dynamic power quality conditioning filters.
        </p>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8;">
          <li><strong>24/7 Wind Power Generation:</strong> Wind energy supplies stable base power for multi-shift metal forging lines.</li>
          <li><strong>Harmonics & Power Quality Filtering:</strong> Integrated active filters eliminate voltage sag trips on sensitive CNC machinery.</li>
          <li><strong>Peak Load Management:</strong> High capacity wind generation lowers overall grid dependence to ~45%.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Financial Breakdown */}
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-10); background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-8); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); color: var(--color-text-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Financial Breakdown & Performance</h2>
        <div class="grid-2" style="gap: var(--space-4); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Turnkey System Investment</span>
            <strong style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--color-text-primary);">~₹12.0 Crores</strong>
          </div>
          <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Monthly Tariff Savings</span>
            <strong style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: #10b981;">~₹28.0 Lakhs / mo (55% Offset)</strong>
          </div>
          <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Annual Tariff Savings</span>
            <strong style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: #10b981;">~₹3.36 Crores / year</strong>
          </div>
          <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">Estimated Payback Period</span>
            <strong style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--color-primary);">~3.8 Years</strong>
          </div>
          <div style="background: var(--color-bg-light); padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: block;">20-Year Lifetime Savings</span>
            <strong style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: #10b981;">~₹67 Crores</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Back to Projects & CTA */}
      <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-4); justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/projects" class="btn btn--secondary">
          ← Back to All Projects
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">
          Get Your Free Savings Analysis →
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</AppLayout>
